# AI Spam Detector

Classify SMS/Email as Spam or Ham using TF-IDF + Naive Bayes.

## Dataset
SMS Spam Collection - 5,572 messages → 5,169 after dropping 403 duplicates
- Ham: 4,516 | Spam: 653

## Pipeline
1. Explore - value_counts, missing, duplicates
2. Clean Text - lowercase, remove punctuation/numbers, remove stopwords
3. TF-IDF - 7,213 vocabulary, Train (4135, 7213)
4. Train/Test Split - 80/20, random_state=42
5. Model - Multinomial Naive Bayes

## Results
- Accuracy: 96.5%
- Confusion Matrix: [[894, 0], [36, 104]]
- Spam Precision: 1.00, Recall: 0.74
- Live Demo: 3/3 correct

## How to Run
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
